# Header-only modules

Single translation unit: `src/main.cpp` `#include`s each `include/*.h` once. No second `.cpp` in `[env:main]` without converting file-scope `static` globals to `inline` (C++17).

## Patterns

- Pins/thresholds → `PinConfig.h`. Tuning constants → `Tuning.h` only.
- No `delay()` in RUN PID paths — use `micros()`/`millis()`.
- PWM: 200 Hz, 10-bit LEDC via `MicromouseMotor`.
- Right encoder distance: `rTicks()` wrapper only.
- `WifiDebug.h` is not compiled into main.

## Motion script

`buildMoveScript` (Planner.h) pushes `PhaseStep`s (max 8): FWD, SPOT_L/R, ALIGN_FRONT, fused fast-run straights. `onPhaseActivate`/`phaseEnter` reset per-phase encoder+yaw snapshots.

## Adding a test env

In `platformio.ini`: `extends = common`, `build_src_filter = +<../test/<file>.cpp>`. Replicate `MOTOR_SLEEP` HIGH in setup.
